  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">ppt 3d 삽입기능으로 한번 만들어보았습니다.<br>구글퀴즈에 삽입하기위해 ppt 영상 내보내기하였습니다.</p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><br></p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">[PPT에 3d사진 넣는&nbsp;방법]</p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">1.sketchfab.com에서&nbsp; 3D 파일을 다운받는다.(확장자obj로)</p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">2.PPT365나 PPT2016에서&nbsp; 삽입-3d모델-파일에서...다운받은 파일을 선택해준다.</p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">3.애니메이션-턴테이블 효과를 넣어준다.</p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><br></p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><br></p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><br></p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><br><br><br><br><br></p> \n<p class=\"cafe-editor-link\"><a class=\"link_attach mov_attach\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NuYDEpnNRO0&amp;feature=youtu.be\"><span class=\"thumb_g\"><img src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/C430x224/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FNuYDEpnNRO0%2Fmaxresdefault.jpg\" width=\"430\" height=\"224\" class=\"thumb_img\" alt=\"암석관찰하기\" onerror=\"this.src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/20240314/cafe_video_default.png'\"><span class=\"ico_cafe ico_attach ico_mov\">동영상</span><span class=\"frame_g\"></span></span><span class=\"cont_info\"><strong class=\"tit_attach\">암석관찰하기</strong><span class=\"desc_attach\">여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요</span><span class=\"source_attach\">www.youtube.com</span></span></a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
